The endgame levels are "no-teleport".  That means that the player can
not teleport by any means and monsters can not teleport by zapping
themselves with wands, by reading teleport scrolls, or innately by
being a nymph or unicorn, for example.  However, covetous monsters can
still "teleport" to you and other monsters can be teleported away by
zapping them with a wand of teleportation (though there are 3 notable
cases where the game negates the effect of this teleport).


